<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>针灸疗法 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E9%92%88%E7%81%B8%E7%96%97%E6%B3%95/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 10:57:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E9%92%88%E7%81%B8%E7%96%97%E6%B3%95/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>缪刺论篇第六十三</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-63/</link><pubDate>Thu, 03 Apr 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-63/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>本文系统阐述了缪刺法的原理与应用，详细介绍了针对不同经络病变的缪刺取穴方法，并强调了左病右治、右病左治的基本原则及其与巨刺法的区别。</description></item><item><title>骨空论篇第六十</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-60/</link><pubDate>Sun, 30 Mar 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-60/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>本文系统阐述了风邪致病的针灸治疗方法，详细介绍了任脉、冲脉、督脉的循行路线及病症表现，并提供了针对不同部位疼痛的取穴原则和灸法应用。</description></item><item><title>长刺节论篇第五十五</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-55/</link><pubDate>Tue, 25 Mar 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-55/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>本文系统阐述了针对不同病症（如筋痹、骨痹、疝气、癫狂等）的针灸治疗原则，强调根据病位深浅、寒热属性调整针刺手法，并注重驱邪外出的关键操作。</description></item><item><title>汤液醪醴论篇第十四</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-14/</link><pubDate>Wed, 05 Feb 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-14/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>黄帝与岐伯对话中，通过讨论五谷制药之理、古人与今人之病因差异、汤药与针灸并用之法，揭示了中医治疗应顺应四时、注重身心平衡、强调“神主形体”，并批评今人医理不察、病发于浅而治于深的弊病，强调“病在本而医在标”的辨证施治思想。</description></item></channel></rss>